# Publish every update

When a change to this game is finished, publish it in the same turn. Do not wait to be asked again.

1. Export the release web build with the existing Web preset. It must stay non-threaded, and it must write `docs/index.html`.
2. Commit the game change and the new `docs/` build together.
3. Push `main` to `origin`.

The live site is https://thomakhy025-code.github.io/vanguard-academy/ and Pages serves `main` from `/docs`.

```
& "C:\Users\User\AppData\Local\Godot\Godot_v4.7.2-stable_win64_console.exe" --headless --path "C:\Users\User\Documents\Unity ai game\Magicandswordupgradegame4" --export-release "Web" "docs/index.html"
```

- Use a PowerShell here-string for the commit message. Do not change git config, force-push, or skip hooks.
- Leave out `.godot/`, Unity folders, and anything with secrets.
- Do not start or leave a server.
- If the export stops because of the firewall or a missing template, stop and tell the user the exact command and error.
- Skip the push only when the user says this change should stay local.
